+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Store SaaS · 平台运营</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/platform/style.css"><script src="/platform/main.js" defer></script></head>
+<body><main><header><div><span class="eyebrow">STORE SAAS</span><h1>平台运营</h1><p>管理试点商户、人工套餐和服务状态。</p></div><button id="logout" class="secondary" hidden>退出</button></header>
+<section id="login"><h2>平台管理员登录</h2><p>使用平台管理员密钥登录。密钥仅保存在当前页面内存中。</p><form id="login-form"><label>平台管理员密钥<input id="key" type="password" autocomplete="off" required></label><button type="submit">登录平台</button></form></section>
+<p id="message" role="status" hidden></p>
+<div id="dashboard" hidden><section><div class="title-row"><h2>服务健康</h2><button id="refresh" class="secondary">刷新</button></div><div id="health" class="cards"></div><p id="backup-status"></p><div id="alerts" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
+<section><div class="title-row"><div><h2>商户与试点套餐</h2><p>暂停后停止新交易，保留已付款订单处理。</p></div><span id="count"></span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>店铺</th><th>状态</th><th>商品</th><th>上传空间</th><th>请求/分钟</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="tenants"></tbody></table></div><div class="pagination"><button id="previous" class="secondary">上一页</button><button id="next" class="secondary">下一页</button></div></section>
+<section id="editor" hidden><h2>修改人工试点套餐</h2><p id="editing-shop"></p><form id="plan-form"><div class="form-grid"><label>商品上限<input name="product_limit" type="number" min="1" max="100000" required></label><label>上传空间上限（MiB）<input name="upload_mib" type="number" min="0.000001" max="1048576" step="any" required></label><label>每分钟请求上限<input name="requests_per_minute" type="number" min="10" max="10000" required></label><label>人工开通备注<input name="manual_reference" maxlength="120" autocomplete="off"></label></div><p>上限不能低于当前用量。此处不处理自动订阅扣款。</p><button type="submit">保存套餐</button><button type="button" id="close-editor" class="secondary">关闭</button></form></section>
+</div><footer>平台页面展示套餐用量与任务状态。商户订单和客户资料由商户后台管理。</footer></main></body></html>
